1. [RESOLVED — 2026-09-17] WHOLE-CORPUS FUZZ WAS PRODUCING 0 FINDINGS (all-ERR).
   ROOT CAUSE (confirmed by reading a hung child's /proc/PID/environ):
     - `.env:14` on the VM hardcoded `TOFU_JS_COV_SLOTS=10000`. run_arm_gpt41.sh
       sources .env -> exports 10000 -> Atheris instruments the 10000-branch
       fake_coverage if-chain = 465s, past the 60+60=120s budget+grace kill ->
       EVERY config SIGKILLed at 120.2s with llm=unknown, 0 findings.
     - The committed run_full_campaign.sh `${VAR:-1024}` never won because .env
       had it SET (not unset); the js_runner code default was also 10000.
     - NOT a contention/leak problem (that was a red herring). Backend was fine
       (gpt-4.1@openai, 2.8s). Instrument cost is O(slots), superlinear:
       512->1.4s, 1024->4.7s, 2000->17s, 10000->465s.
   FIX (committed 3a70d73 + .env edit + reap):
     - .env -> TOFU_JS_COV_SLOTS=1024 (backup .env.bak.*).
     - js_runner.py code default 10000 -> 1024 (footgun removed).
     - Reaped 92 orphan coverage_wrapper.js + leaked `python -m src` (~23h old).
   VALIDATED E2E (real gpt-4.1, temp0, seed): node markdown-downloader 43s
   EXEC_SUMMARY n_exec=1024 success=1024 cov moved; python osm-mcp-server 43s
   real CallToolRequest execution. Both were 100s+ hangs before.
   FOLLOW-UP (not blocking): (a) js_runner.stop() must reap the node wrapper
   child (leak); (b) python predict_instrument_packages over-predicts (instruments
   hundreds of unrelated modules incl. ToFu's own source + junk strings) -> slow,
   fix the predictor; (c) tests/test_audit_regressions.py::test_no_undefined_names
   now RecursionErrors in pyflakes on a third-party file under eval/targets/**
   /.venv (482 prepped venvs) -- ToFu code itself is undefined-name-clean; make
   the audit skip /targets/ and /.venv/ at the WALK, not just in the report.

   SET E, RECALCULATED (the run to spawn): Benchmarks/extraction/build_set_e2.py
   -> set_e2.json from the 482 ready repos (310 node + 172 python), 5830 configs,
   ALL 21 sink families in BOTH langs, tier1=4536 configs. Spawn tier-1-first,
   resumable, in tmux:  ./eval/run_set_e2.sh   (--status / --limit N to smoke).
